WEBVTT

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.740
Not just Candy, but the Décors too...

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:09.050
They've all fallen into his hands...

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:15.500
Not all of them!

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.290
Miyuki?

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:18.860
I just remembered!

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.060
The Star Décor?! But how...?

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.360
I thought it'd look nice on the bamboo, so I hung it from the top!

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.200
Which means...

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:28.840
Right! It's not over yet!

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.280
Reika-chan?

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.690
"I hope I can play with Miyuki and her friends forever-kuru"...

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.600
Is that...

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.280
...Candy's wish card?

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:45.190
Candy...

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:50.160
Look, there's more here!

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:52.260
What does it say?

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:53.980
Here.

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:54.900
What?

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:57.460
This is for me?

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:58.930
This one's for me?!

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:03.340
She wrote wishes for each and every one of us.

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:06.740
Then that does it... We don't have time to sit around moping!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.000
Right!

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.210
But where did he take Candy?

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:13.110
To the Bad End Kingdom, I suspect-de gozaru.

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:14.550
You think so?

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:18.990
It's where Emperor Pierrot is sealed away.

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:20.660
Emperor...

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:21.960
...Pierrot.

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:29.900
First things first, we'll need to enter this book-de gozaru.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:34.870
To get to the Bad End Kingdom, we'll first need to head to Märchenland-de gozaru.

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:36.770
Then let's get movin'!

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:42.540
Follow my lead, my fellows!

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:46.610
Don't worry, Candy, we'll be there soon!

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:40.930
There's just a teensy little question I'd like to ask, if you would indulge me.

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:46.340
Were you granted any special powers during your time in Märchenland, by any chance?

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:49.810
Like, say... the Miracle Jewel?

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:52.270
I've never heard of it-kuru.

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:53.940
Are you certain?

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.180
I haven't-kuru!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.710
Are you <i>certain?</i>

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.180
I'm certain-kuru!

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:04.780
Well, the runt doesn't appear to be lying.

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:08.030
Perhaps she doesn't have anything to do with the Miracle Jewel after all.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:12.360
You're not gonna get away with your mean plans-kuru! The Precure are gonna beat you-kuru!

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.130
You think so, do you?

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:18.270
I think you're forgetting that I possess all sixteen Décors right he—

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:30.380
Well played, Precure.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:31.890
Very well.

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:35.920
Well, we only need one more burst of Bad Energy to revive Emperor Pierrot...

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:39.550
...and what better source for it than them!

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:55.910
Is this...

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.310
...Märchenland?!

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:02.180
It's so pretty!

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:04.320
It's too quiet, though...

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.750
Does nobody live here?

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.760
Oh, they do-de gozaru.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:14.590
But once the Queen was forced into slumber after sealing Pierrot...

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:19.750
...everyone seemed to lose the will to go on, and now remain confined to their homes-de gozaru.

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:21.960
So that's why...

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:25.650
We have to revive the Royal Queen, and fast!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.570
Oh, we can't have that!

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:30.730
I know that voice!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:33.810
You!

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:38.090
My name is Joker. Do try and remember it.

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:39.720
Give Candy back to us-de gozaru!

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:44.150
Ah, but you see, it is <i>I</i> who'd like to make the request here.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:48.120
You see, I would rather like to have that final Decor of yours.

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:51.060
And if we refuse?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.740
Don't pester me with your questions, little girl...

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:57.030
...just hand it over!

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.270
Come on!

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:04.240
Ready?

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:07.650
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:08.660
Go!

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.000
Go, go!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:12.990
Let's go!

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:28.360
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.580
Cure Happy!

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:36.130
Dazzling sun!

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.020
Hot-blooded power!

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:40.590
Cure Sunny!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.400
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.560
Cure Peace!

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:55.320
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.320
Cure March!

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:04.330
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:07.290
Cure Beauty!

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.820
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:22.090
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:52.220
My, my. Is that it?

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:54.850
All right, then...

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.170
Precure...

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.830
Happy...

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:03.670
Shower!

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:24.410
Pop!

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.620
We've gotta give this guy both barrels!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.420
Let's combine our attacks!

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:29.920
Right!

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:32.430
Precure...

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:34.430
Sunny Fire!

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:36.960
Peace...

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.300
Thunder!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:41.450
March...

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.120
Shoot!

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:45.070
Beauty...

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:47.040
Blizzard!

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:50.510
Happy...

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:52.910
Shower!

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.520
Is that really all you can muster?

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.660
How disappointing!

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:08.560
No... No way!

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:24.520
Well, I believe this concludes my business here.

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:28.310
But while I'm here, I think I'll also take...

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:30.780
...the final dose of Bad Energy!

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:34.520
Let this world be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:37.250
...a Bad End!

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:41.220
The blank slate of your future shall be as a cloud of darkness!

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:50.510
What's the matter, girls?

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:53.340
Why not just give in to your despair?

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:57.240
We won't... give in!

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.250
And why not?

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:01.760
I mean, it's not like you're actually in a position to make a difference.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:08.550
You can't even beat me, and you expect to stand up to Emperor Pierrot? Come now.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:13.360
To add to the list... you've no hope of reviving your queen!

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:18.720
All your talk of smiles and shining futures? Out of the question.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:24.030
Which I believe, on the flowchart of life, leaves you with one final possibility.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:28.170
Unending, all-consuming despair!

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:33.470
No...

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.570
What's happening? No way!

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:40.820
Ah, there it is!

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:43.840
My bad energy!

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:49.400
Thank you all so very much!

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:54.250
This will be the final batch of Bad Energy we need!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.770
Now enjoy your despair!

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:16.590
March!

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:23.640
Candy!

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:32.310
What options remain open to us?

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.040
I'm going-de gozaru.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.610
I have to rescue Candy!

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:38.380
That's right! We gotta do that!

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:39.860
Yeah...

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.160
Let us not be hasty.

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:46.900
Unable as we were to even hurt Joker, of what use would we actually be?

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:50.360
He also mentioned this being the "final batch" of Bad Energy.

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:51.820
Which means...

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:54.380
We really need to get movin'!

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.440
But...

00:11:56.200 --> 00:12:01.100
If he <i>does</i> revive Pierrot, and we can't get the Décors back...

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:03.210
...what happens then?

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:10.150
And... what would happen to <i>us?</i>

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:15.020
Would we even be able to get back home?

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:18.810
I don't...

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:23.390
Why? Why is this happening to us?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:27.500
It's because we're the Precure.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:31.370
Saving Märchenland is our mission.

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:35.240
I know! I know it is, but...

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.310
...if I'd known...

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:43.930
We might never see our families, or our friends ever again...

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:48.050
I'm scared... I'm so, so scared.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:51.190
Truth be told, I am too.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:52.890
Me too.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:56.140
I'm feelin' it too.

00:12:57.060 --> 00:13:00.700
Then, what'll happen to Candy?

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:11.010
If we did nothing and just left... we'd be abandoning her.

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:14.210
Nobody's sayin' anythin' about abandonin' her!

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.510
That's what it amounts to!

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:17.850
But that's... that's not...

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:21.910
That's what would... happen...

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:33.800
Then I apologize for dragging you all into this-de gozaru.

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:34.700
Pop?

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.670
You are all still free to return to your homeworld-de gozaru.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:42.140
You all have families back there.

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:45.280
This was always a matter concerning my people,

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.600
so I will bear this burden myself-de gozaru.

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:49.900
No way! You can't do this alone!

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.380
I'm aware.

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.380
Please, be reasonable!

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:55.120
What difference would that make?!

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.350
I have no choice but to go-de gozaru!

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:01.460
I don't care who I face, or whether anyone's at my side!

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:05.110
Because you know what?! Candy's waiting for me-de gozaru!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:08.260
And if I don't go, my sister...

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:09.900
...my <i>Candy</i> will...

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:33.020
I don't know what I should do...

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:38.860
But... I know that we have to think this through before we make any decisions.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:42.000
I'm not good at explaining this, but...

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:48.300
We need to decide... what's most important to us.

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:53.110
Should we risk our lives and our futures to save Candy?

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:58.050
Or... should we go back to our families and friends?

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.020
Or...

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:03.990
...can we find another way?

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:14.360
Then here's what we'll do-de gozaru.

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:15.300
Pop-san?

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:20.280
The path to the Bad End Kingdom only opens during the full moon-de gozaru,

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:22.270
which is tonight.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:25.940
I'll wait for you over there until night comes-de gozaru,

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:31.080
until which time, I leave you all to come to your own decisions.

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:38.360
As Yayoi has stated, pressing on may mean we are unable to return to our homes.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:42.230
So we need to think... <i>really</i> think...

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:46.860
...about what is most important to all of us.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:13.260
What is the most important thing in my life, though?

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:15.230
My mom?

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:16.930
My dad?

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:18.580
My friends?

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:20.950
My classmates?

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:23.220
Being a Precure?

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:25.740
<i>Kuru!</i>

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.470
Or Candy?

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.040
To me, Candy is...

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:35.510
I mean, she's a really great friend...

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:37.980
But...

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:40.740
We came here to save Candy.

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:44.120
But what if...?

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:47.620
Despair...

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:51.330
What is despair, exactly?

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:59.570
Would it be losing my family, or my friends or... my own life?

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:03.070
I couldn't bear it.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:09.640
I want to be with them... my family, my friends, and Candy.

00:17:09.650 --> 00:17:12.580
I want to be together forever!

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:16.550
"I hope I can play with Miyuki and her friends forever-kuru!"

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:22.160
I think it's still...

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:23.860
...in my pocket.

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:25.340
Candy's...

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.300
...wish card...

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:32.870
"I want to keep playing with Miyuki-kuru!"

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:43.940
Candy...

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:51.420
That's right... This all began when I met Candy.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:55.320
I became a Precure thanks to her, and met all my friends.

00:17:56.110 --> 00:18:04.170
All this time we've spent together has been so ultra happy.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:09.440
Yeah... that's why...

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:18.010
I've been thinkin' this over and over, and I still ain't worked it out, yet. But...

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:21.490
"I want to eat okonomiyaki with Akane-kuru!"

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:28.460
It's eatin' away at my heart... and that's all the answer I need.

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:33.800
It ain't about making a choice... it's about what I <i>want</i> to do now!

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:36.770
"I want to draw pictures with Yayoi-kuru!"

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:43.010
It's thanks to Candy and all my friends that I've begun to open up.

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:45.740
It's because of them that I'm the person I am now...

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:49.710
So how can I even think of running now?!

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:57.650
I may be scared of fighting, but not as scared as I am of losing one of my best friends!

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:01.450
If I had to choose what is more precious to me...

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:06.290
Family... or friends? Then I'll choose...

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.900
I'll choose both!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:12.950
How could I even think about sacrificing one for the other?

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:15.270
"I want to play soccer with Nao-kuru!"

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:20.480
My choice was obvious from the start!

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.950
Our world... its people... their smiles.

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:28.150
As a Precure, it is our duty to protect all these things,

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:33.860
yet there are some things I protect not out of duty, but out of my own will.

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:37.390
"I want to do calligraphy with Reika-kuru!"

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.970
And that includes...

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:09.360
I'm sorry, guys.

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:18.040
After all that thinking, I couldn't really decide what was most precious to me.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.510
But I know one thing for sure.

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:25.480
I love Candy!

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:31.210
Just as much as I love my friends, and my family.

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:34.150
That's why we should stick together.

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:40.520
That's all I need for my ultra-happy future!

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:47.200
<i>Ours,</i> you mean?

00:20:58.040 --> 00:20:59.240
You guys...

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.650
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:07.520
Shining bright...

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:10.090
Smile Precure!

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:26.770
Let's go...

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:29.920
Let's save Candy!

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:38.300
Now, King Pierrot! Partake, and delight!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:41.620
For here comes your final burst of Bad Energy!

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.620
At long last, Emperor Pierrot...

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:55.100
...shall return!

00:23:39.500 --> 00:23:42.300
We will save Candy, no matter what!

00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:44.800
Even if it's painful or scary...

00:23:44.800 --> 00:23:46.700
...we will never, ever give up!

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:50.850
We will definitely protect that which is most important to us!

00:23:50.850 --> 00:23:52.800
Everyone, it's a promise.

00:23:52.800 --> 00:23:56.800
We will rescue Candy and then we will all go back home together!

00:23:57.400 --> 00:23:58.630
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.260 --> 00:24:04.900
Find your ultra happy smile!
